
Palo ithuta: ['plus:'] e-bolela: ['+'].
Palo ha-ho-fihla: ['+'] etsa: { :x
	>> rate := 1.
	>> currency := x yuniti-ea-palo.
	(currency = ['euros']) nnete: {
		rate := 2.
	}. <- (uena plus: (x × rate)).
}.
>> dollars := 3.
>> euros := 2.
dollars yuniti: ['dollars'].
euros yuniti: ['euros'].
>> money := dollars + euros.
Sephetho ngola: money, mola-o-mocha.
